  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Att m&#xf6;jligg&#xf6;ra f&#xf6;r HIPC regeringar att utveckla fullt oberoende kapacitet att analysera sin skuldsituation och att utforma och genomf&#xf6;ra deras egen nationella skuldstragegier under och att uppr&#xe4;tth&#xe5;lla en h&#xf6;g skuldhanteringsf&#xf6;rm&#xe5;ga under och efter HIPC initiativet.DRI (Debt Relief International) genomf&#xf6;rande org.DSACBP (Debt Strategy and Ananlysis Capacity Building Program).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To allow HIPC Governments to develop full independent capacity to anlyse their debt situation and to design, and execute their own national debt strategies and to maintain a high level of overall debt management capacity during and beyond the HIPC initiative.DRI (debt Relief International) implementing org.DSACBP (Debt Strategy and Ananlysis Capacity Building Program).</narrative>
  </description>
